                    "text": "International® Financial is your trusted partner for simple, transparent, and flexible financing solutions tailored for the transportation market. Backed by decades of industry experience, we make it easy to secure the right loans or leases — whether you are purchasing new, used, on-highway, vocational, or bus products.",
