                  "id": "intro-t2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We deliver a customer-first experience with fast credit decisions, competitive options, and a dedicated team that understands the transportation industry. From seasonal and skip-payment structures to specialized commercial financing, International Financial helps ensure your business has the support it needs to keep moving forward.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "intro-t3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Rechtien Truck Group provides financing for its customers through a large variety of options, with competitive loans and leases at terms from 12–72 months, and an online credit application that makes the process simple and quick. Once your application is submitted, you will be contacted to discuss your options.",
