                  "id": "intro-t4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Rechtien Truck Group has you covered whether you are looking for financing or prefer to explore leasing. As your business grows and your fleet expands, flexible financing solutions become essential — and for businesses seeking driving power without ownership commitments, our semi-truck leasing options offer flexibility and scalability.",
