                  "props": {
                    "widget": "faq",
                    "config": {
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "q": "What financing and leasing options are available?",
                          "a": "Rechtien Truck Group offers a retail finance loan (12–72 months, fixed cost, with ownership at the end of the loan), a TRAC lease (12–60 months with lower monthly payments and a guaranteed residual) and an FMV lease (lower monthly payments, with the option to return or purchase the equipment at fair market value). Rechtien Truck Group offers semi-truck leasing, including direct leases. International Financial also provides customized leases and secured loans."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "What loan and lease terms are available?",
                          "a": "Rechtien Truck Group offers competitive loans and leases with terms from 12–72 months. Retail finance loans run 12–72 months and TRAC leases run 12–60 months."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Do you finance new and used trucks?",
                          "a": "Yes. Our selections of new and used vehicles are available with customized leases and secured loans, plus truck lease offers that provide an added incentive to buy."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Which brands can I finance?",
                          "a": "International Financial provides customized leases and secured loans for International-branded heavy- and medium-duty commercial trucks. Rechtien Truck Group deals strictly in International or Hino truck, trailer and equipment financing."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Can I get financing if I have had credit problems?",
                          "a": "Even if you have had credit problems in the past, we have a variety of lenders and solutions that will work with us to get you in a truck today."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Are there hidden fees?",
                          "a": "We are straightforward and do not hit you with hidden fees during the life of your loan, because we want to earn your repeat business."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "How do I apply?",
                          "a": "For the fastest response, fill out a credit application and return it to team@rechtien.com. Rechtien Truck Group also offers an online credit application; once it is submitted, you will be contacted to discuss your options. You can also send a financing request using the form on this page."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "snapshot": {
                      "items": []
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
